## 7. Quick-Start Checklist

- [ ] Windows: Set execution policy to Bypass (Process scope only)
- [ ] Windows: Add targeted Defender exclusions for build directories
- [ ] Linux: Enable AppArmor/SELinux strict mode for toolchain binaries
- [ ] All hosts: Use containerized build environment with pinned dependencies
- [ ] All hosts: Compute and sign SHA-256 of every build artifact
- [ ] All hosts: Store signing keys in HSM/TPM only
- [ ] All hosts: Isolate dev network from general internet
- [ ] All hosts: Forward logs to remote SIEM
- [ ] All hosts: Implement Success Vault protocol for operation logging

